  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed two storey side extension, due to its size, design and siting on the return frontage on a prominent corner location and relationship to the existing dwelling would result in a visually intrusive and discordant form of development not appearing subordinate to the existing dwelling and thus resulting in the introduction of a bulky, incongruous and discordant form of development detrimental to the character and open appearance of the existing dwelling and locality.  This would be contrary to Local Plan Policy CP30, Policies DMD14 and DMD37 of the Development Management Document and Policy 7.4 of the London Plan."
